# Version-1.67, Hyrax-1.18.0

  Tagged for Hyrax-1.18.0

- Added GitHub Actions for macOS 15 builds, then disabled automatic OSX GHA runs.
- Fixed GDAL build failures on OSX M4 and Apple Silicon.
- Added a Travis test checking the expected number of built dependencies per OS.
- Fixed the S3 push on merge to master.
- Renamed .build-osx.yml to build-osx.yml and dropped the Mac Intel build.
- Added macOS 26 CI/CD support.
- Stopped producing static dependency builds, switching to non-static tarballs for Rocky 8/9 and OSX.
- Added numbered dependency build tarballs alongside "latest".
- Various tarball naming fixes.
- Added RHEL 9 support.
- Moved to the customized netCDF-4.9.3.
- Updated PROJ to 9.5.1 and added -fPIC to its build flags.
- Added and later removed AWS's s2n-tls.
- Continued AWS SDK build work.
- Allowed lower CMake versions for STARE and jpeg.
- Fixed HDFEOS build when a dev build of libproj is present.
- Added -rpath to LDFLAGS and fixed gdalinfo library lookup on OSX for GDAL.
- Fixed a malformed CMake --config flag.
- Added CPPFLAGS to custom netCDF4 build flags.
- Added a new API for faster offset/length retrieval in chunking storage.
- Added a not-built make target and bumped the patch version.
- Added a pull request template prompting for version bumps.
- Improved documentation.

# Version-1.64

  Current VERSION from Makefile: 1.64

  Packages currently built by the Makefile:

  - bison: bison-3.3
  - jpeg: jpeg-6b
  - openjpeg: openjpeg-2.5.3
  - gridfields: gridfields-1.0.5
  - hdf4: hdf4-hdf4.3.0.e
  - hdfeos: HDF-EOS2.19v1.00
  - hdf5: hdf5-1.14.6
  - netcdf4: netcdf-493-e
  - proj: proj-9.5.1
  - gdal: gdal-3.2.1
  - stare: STARE-1.1.0
  - aws_cdk: aws-sdk-cpp tag 1.11.665

# Version-1.60, Hyrax-1.17.1

